@echo off
:: ???????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????
:: Danbaiwa Restaurant OS ? PWA Launcher (Offline-Ready)
:: ???????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????
:: Launches the INSTALLED Ticket POS PWA app (not raw Chrome).
:: The installed PWA works fully offline after the first internet setup.
:: 
:: FIRST TIME SETUP (requires internet, done once per machine):
::   1. Open Chrome ? go to https://danbaiwa-restaurant-os.vercel.app
::   2. Wait for full load, then click the install icon in the address bar
::   3. Click Install ? pin the app icon to the taskbar
::   4. After that, use THIS .bat OR just click the taskbar icon directly.
::
:: DAILY USE: Just click the Ticket POS icon on the taskbar ? no internet needed.
:: ???????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????

title Danbaiwa Restaurant POS

:: Launch Chrome as an installed PWA app (--app= flag opens it in standalone mode
:: with --kiosk-printing so window.print() goes direct to the thermal printer)
:: Kill any existing Chrome first so --kiosk-printing is picked up on a fresh process.
taskkill /F /IM chrome.exe >nul 2>&1
timeout /t 2 /nobreak >nul

start "" "C:\Program Files\Google\Chrome\Application\chrome.exe" ^
  --app=https://danbaiwa-restaurant-os.vercel.app ^
  --kiosk-printing ^
  --disable-print-preview ^
  --no-first-run ^
  --disable-infobars ^
  --disable-session-crashed-bubble
